{"steam_appid":1270680,"steam_name":"WHALIEN - Unexpected Guests","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1270680/499050/0540c1c3e4793f14cc15bdef04502e1f43b7252f/1751212528/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1663978113","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256907472/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1663978113","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/ss_ae27d8f04ebbab3011b7cfa67272f2dce595c671.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709548774","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/ss_f6c45eb396b2b52f0aa8a880ee5afaa7e8c9fdc8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709548774","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/ss_c9b7289ea53a286e437ac9b4ed5e01c00810eb27.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709548774","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/ss_1698482647a78e20e11a67603471415d2bbd415b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709548774","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/ss_f79ec048b21ca4da185822f1e87a7625b3d0e93e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709548774"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b2b60247fcda83956fa33a9a53d2499b.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b2b60247fcda83956fa33a9a53d2499b.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b2b60247fcda83956fa33a9a53d2499b.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A short heartfelt Adventure!</h2>WHALIEN is a short adventure based around a focused core mechanic that takes you into a charming world full of little details. <br><strong>Estimated playtime: 2-3 hours</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/6216e29736486dbecede6faa08bb61c1.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/6216e29736486dbecede6faa08bb61c1.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/6216e29736486dbecede6faa08bb61c1.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fin needs your Help! </h2>Ernest Hemingwhale is the last remaining person living inside of Fin, the mechanical whale. When one day slimy Squiddies show up and start making a mess, Fin asks for help! Ernest sets out on an adventurous journey through the whale, trying to help his friend get rid of his unexpected guests! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/0f2c158737506e0729def35d56811062.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/0f2c158737506e0729def35d56811062.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/0f2c158737506e0729def35d56811062.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/51b8a97468de697be1449364776aad48.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/51b8a97468de697be1449364776aad48.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/51b8a97468de697be1449364776aad48.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push and Pull!</h2>Use your <strong>Gloves</strong> to push and pull all kinds of objects and elements within your proximity. Use your pearls -<strong>Mr. Push</strong> and <strong>Mrs. Pull</strong> - to manipulate objects from a distance. <br>WHALIEN is designed around pushing and pulling, and everything you do in the game builds upon this mechanic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2bc03f31199d14c24c05ecd020c40a9b.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2bc03f31199d14c24c05ecd020c40a9b.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2bc03f31199d14c24c05ecd020c40a9b.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/bab47dcb3f91249174dd291d3278abec.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/bab47dcb3f91249174dd291d3278abec.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/bab47dcb3f91249174dd291d3278abec.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/20549e01167c6e7d216846390d792214.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/20549e01167c6e7d216846390d792214.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/20549e01167c6e7d216846390d792214.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ba4ae391f3049ed1e13ad9ce5c82831b.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ba4ae391f3049ed1e13ad9ce5c82831b.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ba4ae391f3049ed1e13ad9ce5c82831b.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A <i>fin-tastic</i> world awaits! </h2>Explore colorful locations, meet loveable characters and discover intriguing secrets on your journey through the insides of the whale!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b11208edc9180a046481cb5bef39bf61.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b11208edc9180a046481cb5bef39bf61.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/b11208edc9180a046481cb5bef39bf61.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/9687227ce09d18f75f8a051a86a48954.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/9687227ce09d18f75f8a051a86a48954.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/9687227ce09d18f75f8a051a86a48954.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Ernest Hemingwhale</strong><br>Ernest is the hero of our story. Despite his clumsiness, he gives his best to help Fin, his home and friend<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/be8a841902153a485e134542494447cd.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/be8a841902153a485e134542494447cd.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/be8a841902153a485e134542494447cd.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fin the whale</strong><br>Fin, the mechanical home of Ernest. Using a phonebook and charismatic profile pictures, the two can even chat. An important tool for Fin to help express the worries about his inner whale-being.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2172b9aa247dc0ce7c2253dc4da1fc59.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2172b9aa247dc0ce7c2253dc4da1fc59.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/2172b9aa247dc0ce7c2253dc4da1fc59.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Squiddies</strong><br>Slimy guests that suddenly appeared inside Fin and started making mischief. Some of them even specialize in being a nuisance to Ernest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/c0e17583932943b90e4a42cb0fe2d57d.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/c0e17583932943b90e4a42cb0fe2d57d.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/c0e17583932943b90e4a42cb0fe2d57d.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Springpeople</strong><br>Even more guests? Unlike the Squiddies though, they seem to be quite helpful. What might those springy fellows be up to?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/fdcec73b2fe5b7af9d82b490ed5c4f61.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/fdcec73b2fe5b7af9d82b490ed5c4f61.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/fdcec73b2fe5b7af9d82b490ed5c4f61.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ddbedf809de8c1fafbe538b5318e6544.poster.avif?t=1709548774\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ddbedf809de8c1fafbe538b5318e6544.webm?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270680/extras/ddbedf809de8c1fafbe538b5318e6544.mp4?t=1709548774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core | AMD Ryzen @2,8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 | AMD Radeon HD 7950<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core | AMD Ryzen @3,4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 | AMD Radeon Vega 56<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Forbidden Folds"],"publishers":["Forbidden Folds"],"release_date":"24 Jan, 2023"}